The house skills in this package are Courtyard's own, written for it, under the same licence as
the rest of Courtyard (the MIT License in the repository's LICENSE file). A skill copied from
elsewhere keeps its original licence and notices in its own folder, and is listed here.

Copied skills: none.

Matt Pocock's skills, which code workspaces get, aren't copied here: `matt.json` names the release
of his (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock), and the
worker fetches it into its data folder with his LICENSE file beside his skills.
